window.EN={"1":"Having broken through \"Fort Dandrum,\" Leif's \"Liberation Army,\"","2":"receiving word that the all-out attack on Tahra is near, hurries day and night along the road to Tahra.","3":"And when at last they came to the \"Forest of Dakia\" that spreads east of Tahra,","4":"the surroundings were covered in deep darkness.","5":"Perne, it's time to change shifts. I'll take the watch.","6":"Come to think of it, it's night already. But Salem, are you well enough now?","7":"Yes... Thanks to you, I've recovered. I'm fine now.","8":"Still, those Loptr people do terrible things.","9":"If we hadn't happened by back then, you'd definitely be dead.","10":"...... The Church does not forgive traitors. That is the law...","11":"Traitor? All you did was try to leave the Church. I'd think they didn't have to kill you for it.","12":"...But why did you try to leave?","13":"These days they say a Loptr priest is greater than even the emperor.","14":"I no longer understood... That is the only reason...","15":"Hmm... Well, that's fine.","16":"I like you, and if I can, I'd like you to join us.","17":"You are a thief, but you do not steal from the poor. Nor do you kill.","18":"As long as that holds, I intend to stay here.","19":"I don't kill. It's not to my taste.","20":"But lately we've got more members, and some who won't listen.","21":"Kolkho and his underlings especially are hot-blooded and a problem.","22":"Kolkho is evil. They are attacking travelers.","23":"Yeah, I know. I mean to cut ties with them. Troude and Salem are all I need.","24":"And Tina, hm... Don't do too much mischief. That girl is still a child.","25":"Hahahaha... Well then, I'm counting on you for the watch. The imperial army might come.","26":"I know. To any who approach, I shall grant peaceful slumber with this Sleep staff...","27":"...I must be going now. I'm sorry for the trouble, but please take good care of this girl.","28":"Yes, Father. Please leave it to me.","29":"Lord Saias... Are you leaving?","30":"Yes. I must return to my country.","31":"It pains me to leave you behind, but your illness seems to have healed,","32":"and you should be all right on your own now.","33":"...Father, thank you so very much.","34":"If you hadn't saved me, I...","35":"You seem to regret turning your sword on your mother, but you should forget it now.","36":"That was something you did unavoidably, controlled by Loptr's dark sword.","37":"I have also undone that sword's curse. I will give this to you.","38":"This sword, to me... But...","39":"You said you wanted to become a fine swordswoman like your mother. If so, you must not resent the sword.","40":"A superior sword becomes a cursed sword or a holy sword depending on its wielder's heart.","41":"This sword, too, was not a cursed sword from the beginning.","42":"If you wish to live as a swordswoman, you must love your sword, whatever sword it may be.","43":"If you cannot do that, you cannot be called a fine swordswoman.","44":"Yes... I understand... I will treasure this sword as my bond with Mother.","45":"That is good.","46":"As long as that sword is in your hand, you will one day be reunited with your mother. I have that feeling.","47":"Now, I must be going. We will likely never meet again, but I pray for your happiness.","48":"Thank you. Please take care too, Lord Saias...","49":"Hey, you lot. Some prey's wandered in.","50":"Sneak up and kill 'em. We'll all split the valuables.","51":"Nah, no need to mind what Perne says.","52":"I'll take care of that brat myself. Hit the village while you're at it!!","53":"It seems noisy. Has something happened?","54":"Bandits are attacking a village. Everyone is frightened that they might come to this village too.","55":"Is it the gang of thieves the villagers were talking about?","56":"No, the Dandelion might help us, but they'd never attack a village.","57":"They're probably ruffians who came from somewhere else.","58":"I understand. But please don't worry. I will protect this village.","59":"Don't say foolish things. A girl like you couldn't possibly fight bandits.","60":"No, I am a swordswoman, for all that. I am the daughter of Eyvel of Fiana! I won't lose to bandits!!","61":"Mr. Salem.","62":"Tina. What is it?","63":"Here, a late-night snack. It's cold, so I made something to warm you up.","64":"Thank you. But the night is dangerous. You should go to bed now, Tina.","65":"Okay...","66":"...Are you worried about your sister? Safy, I believe her name was.","67":"It's all right, you'll surely see her. When this wound heals, I'll look for her with you.","68":"Really!? Thank you, Mr. Salem.","69":"Well, good night.","70":"Lord Leif, day has broken. Our field of view opens up.","71":"Lord Leif, this appears to be the hideout of a gang of thieves.","72":"As day has not yet broken, I think we should go in and clear them out...","73":"Yes. But aren't the soldiers tired?","74":"Only the fit ones... let me see... about five would be fine.","75":"Mm, then let's subdue them. The villagers will be glad too.","76":"I am told the thieves of this forest steal money and goods from nobles who side with the Empire and share them out among the poor.","77":"Their leader is a youth named Perne, and the villagers call them noble thieves.","78":"I see... Then let's leave them be. Day has broken, after all.","79":"That would be best. Then let us hurry on. The city of Tahra is very near.","80":"Lord Leif...?","81":"...Mareeta!? Is it you, Mareeta!! Why are you in a place like this...","82":"I'm surprised too.","83":"To think I'd see you and everyone from Fiana again so soon, Lord Leif... it's like I'm dreaming.","84":"Mareeta... I want you to forgive me. Eyvel, for my sake...","85":"No, it is not your fault, Lord Leif. It's because I was immature... because I lost to a cursed sword...","86":"Mareeta, I promise. I will get Eyvel back with my own hands, without fail!","87":"Then me too, with you!","88":"I'll become stronger! So please, take me with you too!","89":"Of course. We can't right away, but someday we'll go back to Munster for sure.","90":"When that time comes, you'll come with us, Mareeta.","91":"Yes! Lord Leif!!","92":"This village is dangerous enough with the thieves around. And now an army on top of that...","93":"Take this vulnerary with you. I hope it's of some use...","94":"Oh, big sis! I was waiting for you. This is yours, right?","95":"I found it in the fort, but I forgot to give it to you. Sorry.","96":"Ahh... Rosa... please come home...","97":"What!? You're the ones who saved my grandchild!","98":"Ohh, I'm so grateful... I'm obliged to you...","99":"This is our family's heirloom. I'll give it to you in thanks. Please make use of it.","100":"Cough, cough, cough... I don't have long either... I wanted to see my grandchild's face one last time...","101":"Ahh, I've been waiting! I heard the story from my son. I hear you took good care of him...","102":"This is my treasure. I'll give it to you in thanks.","103":"I've no business with you! Go away!!","104":"You who violate our forest, begone from here!","105":"Perne... This was for the best...","106":"I see... So you are...","107":"Tch, I blew it. You lot were soldiers!","108":"Graaaaah, now you've done it!","109":"Damn iiiit, you'll remember this!!"};
